        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SCF100, Solid Brass Screw Cover</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this 1\" outside diameter decorative screw cover can be used with wood screws, sheet metal screws or machine screws up to 1/4\" diameter. For use with flat head or tapered screws. Available in 9 decorative finishes. This screw cover are comprised of two pieces: the bottom screw base plate and the top cover plate. To install, put the screw through the bottom base plate hole and tighten the screw. Then, the top cover plate screws onto the bottom base plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SCF100-specifications.gif?v=1704354643\" width=\"597\" height=\"151\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SCF100 Solid Brass Screw Cover Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-decorative-screw-cover-deltana-scd100\"><b>Deltana SCD100 Decorative Screw Cover</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for the Deltana SCF100 Decorative Screw Cover:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Outside Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Hole Diameter: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCF100.pdf?v=1691095383\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SCF100 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sleek Screw Cover | Deltana SCF100",
                "description": "Solid Brass Screw Cover, Deltana SCD100 - Made of solid brass, this 1 inch outside diameter decorative screw cover can be used with wood screws, sheet metal screws or machine screws up to 1/4 inch diameter. For use with flat head or tapered screws. Available in 9 decorative finishes. This screw cover are comprised of two pieces: the bottom screw base plate and the top cover plate. To install, put the screw through the bottom base plate hole and tighten the screw. Then, the top cover plate screws onto the bottom base plate.",
